LTDP is a fork of LeGoTDP (https://github.com/Rayekkk/LeGoTDP), adapted to the
original Lenovo Legion Go (83E1, Ryzen Z1 Extreme). The original work and its
copyright are unchanged; the port adds a per-device capability table, an
acpi_call backend for the Lenovo GameZone firmware interface, an English and
Russian interface, and the diagnostics that go with them.

