================================================================================
Interface documentation used by the acpi_call backend
================================================================================

The Lenovo "Other Method" / GameZone WMI interface (\_SB.GZFD.WMAE / WMAA), its
attribute-id encoding and its custom-mode requirement were taken from the
mainline kernel drivers in drivers/platform/x86/lenovo/ (GPL-2.0-or-later,
Copyright (C) 2025 Derek J. Clark) and from Handheld Daemon's adjustor
(https://github.com/hhd-dev/adjustor). No code from either project is included
here; only the documented wire format is implemented.

